"""Curriculum-aligned openings for English A1, A2 and B1 pages.

For every grammar id that a COSYplatform lesson teaches (curriculums/en/*/*.json -> grammarIds), the opening's theme
and sentences use that lesson's topic and vocabulary. `lesson` names the lesson the opening is drawn from; scripts/check_open_vocab.py
verifies that lesson exists and teaches this grammar id (needs the cosyplatform repo next to this one).
The formula is inherited from the base entry unless given."""

def L(subj, ans, tail="", hint=""):
    return (subj, ans, tail, hint)

def _o(lesson, theme, q, lines, formula=None, label=None):
    return dict(lesson=lesson, theme=theme, q=q, lines=lines, formula=formula, label=label)

